QTable is a component that allows you to display data in a tabular manner. It’s generally called a datatable. It packs the following main features: Filtering Sorting Single / Multiple rows selection with custom selection actions Pagination (including server-side if required) Grid mode Total customization of rows and cells through scoped slots Column picker Custom top and/or bottom Table controls Responsive design

